{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TfhL9pybDbziZxPtbppS1K","type":"tool_result","content":"total 112\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 6 user  wheel    192 Nov  4 17:29 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 5 user  wheel    160 Nov  4 17:29 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   2087 Nov  4 17:29 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel  44233 Nov  4 17:30 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   2091 Nov  4 17:29 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   1123 Nov  4 17:29 router.py\nimport re\n\n# Step 1: complaints about a bad/wrong exchange rate on a card payment or\n# cash withdrawal go to fees_fx, even when they read like a dispute.\n_RATE = re.compile(r\"\\b(exchange|conversion|fx)\\b|\\brates?\\b|\\bconver(t|ted|sion)\\b\", re.I)\n_WRONG = re.compile(\n    r\"\\b(wrong|incorrect|bad|poor|terrible|awful|off|unfair|less|lower|\"\n    r\"issue|problem|mistake|error|not right|didn'?t match|doesn'?t match)\\b\",\n    re.I,\n)\n\n# Step 2: anything about a card PIN (change, unblock, reset, compromised)\n# goes to cards, not account_security. Word boundary keeps \"pinned\" etc. out;\n# \"passcode\" is the app login and stays in account_security.\n_PIN = re.compile(r\"\\bpins?\\b|\\bpersonal identification number\\b\", re.I)\n\n\ndef route(text, laya_dept):\n    t = text or \"\"\n    if laya_dept == \"disputes\" and _RATE.search(t):\n        return \"fees_fx\"\n    # Cards can also catch \"card payment + wrong rate\"; require a complaint word.\n    if laya_dept == \"cards\" and _RATE.search(t) and _WRONG.search(t):\n        return \"fees_fx\"\n    if laya_dept == \"account_security\" and _PIN.search(t):\n        return \"cards\"\n    return laya_dept\ntext\tlaya_answer\tcorrect\nWhat are the age requirements for service?\tcards\taccount_security\nCan you tell me what countries you offer support for?\tcards\taccount_security\nCan I get a card even though I live in the US\tcards\taccount_security\nIs it possible to get a card outside the UK?\tcards\taccount_security\nHow old do my kids need to be to use your service?\tcards\taccount_security\nwhere do you have locations at\tdisputes\taccount_security\nCan I open an account for my children?\tcards\taccount_security\nDo you have an age limit?\tcards\taccount_security\nDo you have to be 18 to make an account?\tcards\taccount_security\nCan I use this all over the world?\tcards\taccount_security\nWhich countries do you support?\tcards\taccount_security\nI don't live in the UK. Can I still get a card?\tcards\taccount_security\nWhich countries do you work with?\tcards\taccount_security\nHow old do you need to be to open an account?\tcards\taccount_security\nDo you have any accounts for children ?\tcards\taccount_security\nDo you support all countries?\tcards\taccount_security\nI would like to have a physical card to carry around and use. How can I get one?\tcards\tcards\nI have to make more then a few disposable cards per day.\tcards\tcards\nHow do I activate a card?\tcards\tcards\nI dont have identification\taccount_security\taccount_security\nWhat forms of ID do you need for identity verification?\taccount_security\taccount_security\ni am express delivering my card to the us, how long will that take\tcards\tcards\nWhere do I get a virtual card?\tcards\tcards\nI would like to track the card you sent to me.\tcards\tcards\nWhat is the identity check for?\taccount_security\taccount_security\nIs there a way to order a virtual card on the website?\tcards\tcards\nI have some transactions on my account I did not make. Can you cancel my card and prevent further use.\tcards\tcards\nHow do I modify my account details?\taccount_security\taccount_security\nWhich merchants accept my card?\tcards\tcards\nI can't access my account.\taccount_security\taccount_security\nHow to a go about ordering a disposable virtual card?\tcards\tcards\nI need my card soon.\tcards\tcards","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"15d8383a-e090-4e07-a750-a0a92e153d2d","uuid":"b46bb7e1-f912-4e30-85bb-127039fbe257","time